.TH openalex-snapshot 1
.SH NAME
openalex-snapshot \- OpenAlex snapshot pipeline CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B openalex-snapshot
.RI [COMMAND] [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Root-dir-first CLI for OpenAlex snapshot download, conversion, verification, schema inspection, indexing, and repair.
Argument precedence: CLI arguments > config subcommand section > config defaults section > built-in defaults.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B check
Environment/capacity preflight checks.
.TP
.B download
Sync snapshot from S3.
.TP
.B verify_download
Strict snapshot integrity validation.
.TP
.B convert
Convert JSON.GZ to parquet.
.TP
.B verify_convert
Verify snapshot/parquet parity.
.TP
.B schema
Inspect schema.
.TP
.B verify_schema
Assert schema parity across sources.
.TP
.B index
Build lookup index parquet.
.TP
.B verify_index
Verify index integrity.
.TP
.B repair_convert
Reconvert failed files from verify report.
.TP
.B report
Show run reports.
.TP
.B prune-reports
Prune old reports.
.TP
.B progress
Show live run progress.
.TP
.B skills
Bootstrap `skills/` folder for AI agents.
.TP
.B config
Create/verify YAML config.
.SH EXAMPLES
openalex-snapshot check --root-dir /data --dataset all

openalex-snapshot convert --root-dir /data --dataset works

openalex-snapshot verify_convert --root-dir /data --dataset works --scope dataset --metadata-level both

openalex-snapshot repair_convert --root-dir /data --from-verify-report /data/.openalex-snapshot_metadata/reports/verify_convert-123456.json
.SH SEE ALSO
openalex-snapshot-convert(1), openalex-snapshot-verify(1), openalex-snapshot-schema(1), openalex-snapshot-index(1), openalex-snapshot-repair(1), openalex-snapshot-download(1), openalex-snapshot-verify_download(1), openalex-snapshot-skills(1), openalex-snapshot-check(1)
